{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo of Aquachamber will be a 20-minute experience slice, allowing you to explore the core design and gameplay. You will feel the same sense of curiosity and mystery as in the full version. Please note that during future development, the demo may not represent the final quality of the complete game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aquachamber is a first-person puzzle game where you constantly return to the starting point. Explore this mysterious space and use your logic to uncover clues\u2014every strange phenomenon follows a hidden pattern. The game contains no monsters or jump scares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mysterious Poolcore Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore within the mysterious poolcore space, experience the artistic styles and emotional atmospheres across different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/370d68bafb4311efa3f6c4f0a7e4fa92.poster.avif?t=1761193434\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/370d68bafb4311efa3f6c4f0a7e4fa92.webm?t=1761193434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/370d68bafb4311efa3f6c4f0a7e4fa92.mp4?t=1761193434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Exploration and Puzzle Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully observe the details of this world, and deduce the principles behind the things that make you curious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/18d7204f7e0bafac7276c8b3ee6164ff.poster.avif?t=1761193434\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/18d7204f7e0bafac7276c8b3ee6164ff.webm?t=1761193434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/18d7204f7e0bafac7276c8b3ee6164ff.mp4?t=1761193434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Horror Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aquachamber might have some tense atmospheres, but it is essentially a puzzle game, not a horror game. There are no monsters jumping out at you or frightening elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/9b01edc7676ae9f622da6a3778037a53.poster.avif?t=1761193434\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/9b01edc7676ae9f622da6a3778037a53.webm?t=1761193434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/extras/9b01edc7676ae9f622da6a3778037a53.mp4?t=1761193434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104190?t=1761193434","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104190?t=1761193434","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/6428f1ea1131b3b398c98369c78b692f44925569/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761193434","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104190/6428f1ea1131b3b398c98369c78b692f44925569/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761193434","categories":[{"d